<Item XName="Flexible OFDM Measurement" UserName="Flexible OFDM Measurement" Type="Notes">
<Description>Example text with pretty printing</Description>
<LibName>Eagleware</LibName>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;Flexible&amp;nbsp;OFDM Measurement&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This example workspace demonstrates swept BER vs SNR measurement for flexible OFDM system. SISO flexOFDM and MIMO flexOFDM with/without LDPC coded are tested in AWGN (Additive White Gaussian Noise) channel and fading channel.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;SystemVue FlexOFDM Application can generate various OFDM waveforms. One Flexible OFDM frame consists of idle, preamble (Preamble 1 and Preamble 2) and payload data (Data 1 and Data 2) including pilots. Customers can configure their own OFDM frame according to their requirement. In receiver Preamble1 is used for synchronization and the default data of Preamble1 are the same in different antennas. If the data of Preamble1 are not the same in different antennas, performance degradation would appear. Preamle2 or Pilots could be chosen to do channel estimation.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Preamble 2 can be switched ON or OFF. Data 2 (Payload 2) also can be turn ON or OFF. There are only the Data 1 (Payload 1) and the Preamble1 which should be always presence for receiver.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In MIMO mode of FlexOFDM, only 1x1, 2x2, 4x4, 8x8 are supported in this example. In fading channel,&amp;nbsp;1x2, 2x2, 2x4, 4x4, 2x8, 4x8, 8x8&amp;nbsp;are supported.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Simulation Instruction&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;To get the simulation run, the following parameters should be set properly.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;1.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In MIMO page of UI on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Source_RF, &#x2018;NumOfSubcarriersPerBlock&#x2019; should be set as the divisor of &#x2018;NumUsefulSubcarriers&#x2019;. &#x2018;NumOfSymbolsPerBlock&#x2019; should be set as the divisor of &#x2018;NumOfSym&#x2019;.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;2.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In Preamble page of UI on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Source_RF, the length of &#x2018;Preamble_CarrierIndex&#x2019; should be consistent with the value in &#x2018;Preamble_NumOfCarriers&#x2019;. The parameter &#x2018;Preamble1_Seq&#x2019; and &#x2018;Preamble2_Seq&#x2019; are the value of Preamble in all antennas, and the data are mapping to the location in the sequence of antenna 1, antenna 2 and so on. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;3.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In Data page on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Source_RF, &#x2018;Data_NumOfCarriers&#x2019; could be an array, the element of the array is the number of data carriers per symbol. The length of &#x2018;Data_NumOfCarriers&#x2019; should be set as the divisor of &#x2018;NumOfSym&#x2019;. &#x2018;Data_CarrierIndex&#x2019; should be consistent with the value in &#x2018;Data_NumOfCarriers&#x2019;.&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;4.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In Pilot page on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Source_RF, the value of parameter &#x2018;Pilot1_Seq&#x2019; are the value of pilots in all antennas, and the value are mapping to the location in the sequence of antenna 1, antenna 2 and so on.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;5.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In MIMO page of UI on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Receiver_RF, two kinds of the structure on Preamble2 and pilots are provided according to LTE system (Non-Overlapping) and WLAN system (Overlapping). If Preamble2 is chosen to estimate the channel, only Overlapping type is available.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;6.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;In RxAlgorithm page of UI on FlexOFDM_MIMO_Receiver_RF, Preamble2 or pilots is chosen to do channel estimation by parameter &#x2018;PilotsBasedChannelEst&#x2019;. &#x2018;PhaseTrackingEnable&#x2019; is available when channel estimation is based on Preamble2.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;7.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The values of pilots and preamble are set by function &apos;randn&apos;, which may cause different value at the output of models. But it would have litter effect on the BER measurement. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;&apos;&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Most of the parameters are set in Equation considering the relationship between parameters and the consistence of source and receiver. If parameter is changed in GUI, please change the value of the certain variable in the Equation.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In Equations, common setting is given at the top. Then three&amp;nbsp;kinds of&amp;nbsp;setting are proposed&amp;nbsp;according to the different setting on &apos;PilotsBasedChannelEst&apos; and &apos;MIMOType&apos;.And the performance of these two examples in AWGN channel and fading channel are given in the figure. In order to get better channel estimation performance, please change the setting of &apos;FrequencyInterval&apos; and &apos;TimeInterval&apos; for interpolation&amp;nbsp;in channel estimation according to the pilots pattern. Also, setting proper &apos;Tmax&apos; and &apos;Fmax&apos; for different channel. &apos;Tmax&apos; is set to 0.01us in AWGN channel and set to 1.1 us in EVA fading channel. And the DataAdjust is set to 0 in AWGN and &amp;nbsp;13 in fading channel in this example.&amp;nbsp;The setting of AWGN and fading channel in the example is shown below.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TABLE class=MsoTableGrid style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt&quot; cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 border=1&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TBODY&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 77.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt&quot; vAlign=top width=103&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 65.95pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt&quot; vAlign=top width=88&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;LDPC coding&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 79.65pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt&quot; vAlign=top width=106&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Interleave&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt sol